# This is a monorepo; the Vercel project's Root Directory is backend/, but `vercel deploy` still
# uploads from wherever the CLI is invoked (the repo root) before that trim happens. Without this,
# it sweeps up the React Native app's node_modules/android/ios build artifacts (multiple GB) and
# blows past Vercel's 100MB per-file upload limit. Keep only what backend/'s own build needs.
/android
/ios
/src
/node_modules
/backend/node_modules
/design-reference
/docs
/supabase
*.apk
*.aab
*.ipa
